This source package repackages the prebuilt Linux binaries from the upstream
SolidCraft GitHub release.

Upstream does not publish a Debian source package and Launchpad builders have no
network access, so the upstream .deb files are vendored in the orig tarball:

  vendor/solidcraft-linux-x86_64.deb
  vendor/solidcraft-linux-aarch64.deb

debian/rules unpacks the .deb matching the build architecture with dpkg-deb -x.
The binaries are not rebuilt, stripped or otherwise modified.

scripts/fetch-upstream.sh downloads and checksums those files;
scripts/build-source.sh generates the orig tarball and the per-series
debian/changelog entry. The Debian version appends "ppa1" to the upstream
Debian revision (0.17.0-1 becomes 0.17.0-1ppa1).
